From 8383bc413e35969da6f2f2564bf54fbe7416ea31 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anmoti <77442643+anmoti@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 09:52:09 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] cursor: draw themed X11 cursors through the parent too

Use wlr_xwayland.cursor_name (XFixes) to tell which cursor X11 displays:
named ones are mapped from their Xcursor names to cursor-shape-v1 and
drawn by the parent compositor; unnamed ones fall back to Xwayland's
cursor image.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012X41FaHDG1j8zRZcCfwo6r
---
 include/input/cursor.h |   3 ++
 src/input/cursor.c     | 115 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/xwayland.c         |  14 +++++
 3 files changed, 132 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/input/cursor.h b/include/input/cursor.h
index 3d7aa71a..8a333af7 100644
--- a/include/input/cursor.h
+++ b/include/input/cursor.h
@@ -125,6 +125,9 @@ void cursor_update_focus(void);
  */
 void cursor_update_image(struct seat *seat);
 
